{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest a journey to Japan's fair shore\nA land of rising sun where ancient secrets lie in store\nI shall craft for thee an itinerary most wondrous and grand\nTo guide thee through the mystic realms of this enchanted land\n\nAct I Scene I\n\nUpon thy arrival in Tokyo's bustling streets\nThou shalt behold the majestic Tokyo Tower's mighty feats\nIts latticework of steel and glass doth pierce the urban sky\nAs thou embarkest on thy adventure thou shalt not say goodbye\n\nTo the city's vibrant heart where ancient temples meet\nThe neon lights of Shibuya's famous crossing doth greet\nThe throngs of people rushing to and fro with frantic pace\nAs thou dost stroll along the Sumida River's tranquil face\n\nAct I Scene II\n\nNext thou shalt journey to the famous Tsukiji Fish Market's gate\nWhere thou shalt behold the freshest seafood in all the state\nThou shalt sample sushi of the finest grade and taste\nAs thou embarkest on a culinary adventure most exquisite and vast\n\nAct II Scene I\n\nIn the morning thou shalt visit the Meiji Shrine's hallowed ground\nA serene oasis in the heart of Tokyo's bustling sound\nThou shalt pay homage to the deities and offer thy prayer\nAs thou dost walk along the sacred paths with reverence and care\n\nAct II Scene II\n\nIn the afternoon thou shalt visit the Tokyo National Museum's halls\nWhere thou shalt behold the treasures of Japan's ancient calls\nThou shalt see the samurai armor and the scrolls of old\nAs thou embarkest on a journey through the ages to behold\n\nAct III Scene I\n\nNext thou shalt journey to the city of Kyoto's gentle heart\nWhere ancient temples and gardens doth play their part\nThou shalt visit the Fushimi Inari Shrine's thousand gates\nAs thou embarkest on a spiritual journey to the heavens' gates\n\nAct III Scene II\n\nIn the morning thou shalt visit the Kinkaku-ji Temple's golden shore\nA tranquil oasis in the heart of Kyoto's bustling roar\nThou shalt behold the beauty of the garden's carefully laid design\nAs thou embarkest on a journey of serenity and peace of mind\n\nAct IV Scene I\n\nIn the afternoon thou shalt visit the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove's mystic shade\nWhere thou shalt behold the towering stalks of bamboo in array\nThou shalt walk along the winding paths with gentle pace\nAs thou embarkest on a journey of discovery and wonder in this enchanted place\n\nAct V Scene I\n\nFinally thou shalt journey to the city of Osaka's vibrant heart\nWhere thou shalt behold the neon lights and the bustling streets' art\nThou shalt visit the Osaka Castle's majestic walls and towers high\nAs thou embarkest on a journey of adventure and wonder in this fair city's sky\n\nThus ends thy journey through Japan's wondrous land\nMay thy heart be filled with wonder and thy spirit expand\nMay the memories of this enchanted land forever stay\nIn thy heart and mind as thou embarkest on thy journey back home's way.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.85221833}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.5111953}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.19632839}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.062069237}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.10045276}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -1.9248961}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -0.52037597}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.154565}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.4819206}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.06817328}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0009177287}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -2.0235958}, {"token": " sun", "logprob": -0.00033980794}, {"token": " where", "logprob": -0.4817194}, {"token": " ancient", "logprob": -1.906789}, {"token": " secrets", "logprob": -1.8017993}, {"token": " lie", "logprob": -1.